            "text": "The thin PFG shirts are usually called **Columbia PFG fishing shirts** or **PFG performance shirts**.\n\nIf you mean the lightweight, silky, long-sleeve sun shirts, they\u2019re often called:\n\n- **PFG Terminal Tackle shirts**\n- **PFG long-sleeve performance shirts**\n- **PFG sun shirts**\n- **UPF fishing shirts**\n- **Moisture-wicking fishing shirts**\n\nIf you mean the button-up kind with vents, those are usually called:\n\n- **PFG Tamiami shirts**\n- **PFG Bahama shirts**\n- **PFG vented fishing shirts**\n\n\u201cPFG\u201d stands for **Performance Fishing Gear**, Columbia\u2019s fishing/outdoor clothing line.",
